      "side": 1,
      "message": "Questions about using real device assigning hypervisor (aosp/2854493):\n\n- Questions) Can we proceed booting when hypervisor is missing, if no device is assigned?\n  - If so, Should it be obtained in `entry.rs` and passed to `device_assignment.rs`? What about `device_assignment.rs` gets it by itself when necessary because hypervisor is singleton?",
