      "writtenOn": "2023-12-05T16:52:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMO, if `hyp::get_device_assigner().is_none()` and `vm_dtbo().is_some()`, we should log an error and skip the DA path but still boot (with all assigned devices stripped, naturally) as there\u0027s no reason to prevent non-DA VMs from booting; WDYT?",
